    "k": 1,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Section B interview.",
    "zh": "B节：访谈。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interview"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen003.png",
    "sha256": "6d3b3680859e7d49d8365a42a6f0c25c6e1c553fc7742132a938cbbc774dac6a",
    "k": 2,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "In this section, you will hear one interview.",
    "zh": "在这一节中，你将听到一段访谈。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interview"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen004.png",
    "sha256": "78ac45db05eb3e425b1400ca709b41971fcb46d3c0a8812f25fde511d1f62ea7",
    "k": 3,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "The interview will be divided into two parts.",
    "zh": "这段访谈分为两部分。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "divide"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen005.png",
    "sha256": "4a055a035517ca9ef54a41c5ccb2e096644cff0529d8e4717ffd6da21b83c606",
    "k": 4,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "At the end of each part, five questions will be asked about what was said.",
    "zh": "每部分结束后，将就刚才所说的内容提出五个问题。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "question"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen006.png",
    "sha256": "3800813fae5f910478e6a860bee8bd48857a97839a205b4746e017f57351a134",
    "k": 5,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "Both the interview and the questions will be spoken once only.",
    "zh": "访谈和问题都只读一遍。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "once"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen007.png",
    "sha256": "927c75a218919e99844f3720aaebe6376b27179efa23a9ed4eebb9c1b5a4b0d7",
    "k": 6,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "After each question, there will be a ten-second pause.",
    "zh": "每个问题之后会有十秒钟的停顿。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "pause"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen008.png",
    "sha256": "cc97ed6b5d66f580b43e398b87fa7f6a0ca287975d5dd7b4c61935128ba3eae9",
    "k": 7,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "During the pause, you should read the four choices of A, B, C, and D and mark the best answer to each question on answer sheet 2.",
    "zh": "请利用停顿时间阅读A、B、C、D四个选项，并在答题卡二上标出每题的最佳答案。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "choice"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen009.png",
    "sha256": "c6e8568c5d628bce0d1a0e24fb7c97f8b2fb760de946cce22cafa631c3f18149",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "You have 30 seconds to preview the choices.",
    "zh": "你有三十秒钟预览选项。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "preview"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen010.png",
    "sha256": "df159fc5e31698232e04e0e309eb56e29ea9d53c4985c002361e31b7bce9966d",
    "k": 9,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Now listen to part one of the interview.",
    "zh": "现在请听访谈的第一部分。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "listen"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "bd8f47b21f6244766a0395aaaecfc7ced9f59d1abab67b54b2ff58c71a7e2d1f",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Questions one to five are based on part one of the interview.",
    "zh": "第1至5题根据访谈的第一部分提问。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be based on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "4478cae77c6d00530f7c97d984403ea8a9e95deba90d83faad09d27d29873c9c",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Maureen McLane is a poet and critic.",
    "zh": "莫琳·麦克莱恩是一位诗人和评论家。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "critic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "47c8c57ca2ff7e3657210690bd7a3220787a45cb94531f48a371b649c1c9e138",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "After her undergraduate studies in American history and literature, she studied English literature on a scholarship before earning her Ph.D. at the University of Chicago.",
    "zh": "她本科时学习美国历史和文学，随后获得奖学金学习英国文学，之后在芝加哥大学取得博士学位。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "scholarship"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "2007d4c8cc549b32a5367e245df52f0f7889baf5cc695c9cc8a1bca2fa753e7e",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "In addition to academic publications on British romanticism, Maureen McLane has written a number of memoirs and criticism.",
    "zh": "除了有关英国浪漫主义的学术著作，莫琳·麦克莱恩还写过一些回忆录和评论作品。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "romanticism"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "17da12f88cb3250f5b5ba96e49b6029bc6d2a7016c11914fc872dcb68cfd7555",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "One of them, My Poets, became a finalist for the 2012 National Book Critics Circle Award in autobiography.",
    "zh": "其中一本《我的诗人》，入围了二〇一二年美国国家书评人协会奖的自传类奖项。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "poet",
      "finalist",
      "award"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "e581a47b1f7a41f1c8837a8c5478ff36be17a5532dd350b01618d0a5525b19f0",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "And her most recent collection of poetry, This Blue, was a finalist for the 2014 National Book Award.",
    "zh": "她最近出版的诗集《这片蓝》，也入围了二〇一四年美国国家图书奖。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "collection of poetry"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "3516d92377a5bfaa75377861500716d8aca3a69bacc4fe4975a69a374985ac74",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Today, we have Maureen McLane, now professor of English at New York University, with us on the radio show.",
    "zh": "今天，我们请到了现任纽约大学英语教授莫琳·麦克莱恩，做客本台广播节目。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "professor"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "022cd2620cd64c2121e65a0d927c3b00408f0ab1d7ff009c2550ba1c4ae1bc05",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Good evening, Maureen.",
    "zh": "晚上好，莫琳。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Good evening"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "9376d06ea5811055435d136d0762d266d24545a41a704b6ac56fc67dae8275df",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Good evening!",
    "zh": "晚上好！",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Good evening"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "d97c00967eec1e3a06efdd6efdee6826092bb7c59f2b492b26254c9dec512724",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Now, can you tell us when you first began to read poetry?",
    "zh": "您能告诉我们，您最早是什么时候开始读诗的吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "poetry"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "4ad090d3a9c81bc97a5c65b12b58f119ae6132d2d4d72d0ea2cce362c077aa3e",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I would probably say, in my high school days.",
    "zh": "我想应该是在高中时期。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "high school"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "2bbe9a43953444b46fcc3f0e5af5e5b4cca2feb039b5bb46645025bb6a01b5f2",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Of course, there had been some other things in the environment in my childhood before high school, ",
    "zh": "当然，在高中之前，我童年时的生活环境中也有其他相关事物，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "childhood"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "a38130154fbce96b0b68db3011ce66e6f6d2f2770d3dbade333b0c40333dbd16",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "like nursery rhymes, hymns, my mother’s playing piano and guitar, poems my father might come out with.",
    "zh": "比如童谣、赞美诗、母亲弹奏钢琴和吉他，以及父亲随口念出的诗句。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "nursery rhyme"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "f7bbe899600990fee3efb6071e99f0cce1d874c0afd793b11de4ae269d6afab2",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "But in terms of reading poetry, it really came about through high school.",
    "zh": "但是，真正开始阅读诗歌，还是在高中阶段。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "come about"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "597caaf71e3d8bac2342e6fb44cb35445b195237252ff2facc8e755c13da3c60",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Literature classes in general were very stimulating to me.",
    "zh": "总的来说，文学课对我很有启发。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "stimulating"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "0a9dac047c6cb77c7302003ef5b87cd47090b7ec4c6223ee3575313a1a261a19",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "You begin one section of My Poets by talking about the lecture course you took in your freshman year with Helen Vendler, ",
    "zh": "在《我的诗人》的一个章节开头，您谈到了大一时上的海伦·文德勒的讲座课，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "freshman year"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "c81ba5d2741d70c5874857ae097b3a164f58baba5e0696c22668adda792607a2",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "and the poetry section you had with William Corbett.",
    "zh": "以及威廉·科贝特教授的诗歌课。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "poetry"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "350616a114be266bb6d7faaf30df73f281ad464693d6b9e041f5dd5a2910bbf8",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Were there other teachers who were important to you?",
    "zh": "还有其他对您很重要的老师吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "important"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "ffe5c6c74dedf3124eb4ec9ab958a3b5cf0c9e42696409ba69c9f9513bcecc6f",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Well, there were several people important to me who weren't poetry people at all — they were historians or professors of music.",
    "zh": "对我很重要的几个人，完全不是诗歌界人士，而是历史学家或音乐教授。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "historian"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "fe54ecd1e40d01f988c1810b835cb206a8f7606bb5a2838544ea3d7544ad3c94",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Oh, that’s interesting.",
    "zh": "哦，这很有意思。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interesting"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "95711a3314b7186979843e8d2d2a34ae9c61386a6b0d6453226cd27ad552c209",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I had a wonderful tutor, now a professor of English at the University of Chicago, Janice Knight.",
    "zh": "我有过一位很出色的导师，贾妮丝·奈特，她现在是芝加哥大学的英语教授。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "tutor"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "e95fb41cb360a967869b46bf983f4f87aacdcee12f90b6b3fc28380f66ef992f",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Janice was and is a scholar of colonial America, but she also knew a lot about a certain line in American poetry.",
    "zh": "贾妮丝过去和现在一直是一位研究殖民地时期美国的学者，但她也很熟悉美国诗歌的某一流派。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "colonial"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "5c6118f754efaa61a1aa64037afb0dc01c797b359c488d1f09df1bf0725220ba",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "She introduced me to Susan Howe’s work.",
    "zh": "她让我接触到了苏珊·豪的作品。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "introduce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "b8736b37adb15cde0ebea2374d6f11e5c6cb82f34c9fbd1a3aec8afe9fca483b",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I mean, those people became important to me in various ways.",
    "zh": "我的意思是，这些人以不同的方式对我产生了重要影响。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "in various ways"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "b4e382d7268ce526e6657a7ef704d536112894b4eff47f43a6c01c03185bfaa2",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I almost feel as if in the end the poets themselves are the most important teachers.",
    "zh": "我几乎觉得，到头来，诗人本人就是最重要的老师。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "in the end"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "069d885d41c91c4d089b677d80107229217279023ad9171c309c4b5ea77fd6ca",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I do think that if you bend towards becoming a writer, at the end of the day, it’s writing that teaches you, I mean, other writers’ works.",
    "zh": "我确实认为，如果你倾向于成为一名作家，归根结底，教会你写作的是写作本身；我是指其他作家的作品。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "at the end of the day"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "ac82c50cfa9078dc20bab48220b1058bc61c85e772ddbf1c3e616bd20fdddf3a",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "You were an undergraduate at Harvard, and then you returned to teach there.",
    "zh": "您在哈佛读过本科，后来又回到那里任教。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "undergraduate"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "d5e03865b02440b8e91efdc22d90bdbafd6bc1f9c0a5f575c18f443f27a1c5f4",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "What was that like?",
    "zh": "那是一种怎样的体验？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "like"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "5a389d5b9c06f94a795793dc6d4cdf56c5baef28cbc5000e6249176a149b523e",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "When I returned, I was at a very different phase of life.",
    "zh": "回去的时候，我已处于人生中一个很不一样的阶段。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "phase of life"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "dc9eea509a7de4b2f2d4a7565fcadd09c96209d6b7854811d3afb0c6a9d97d51",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "Being back as a professor, Cambridge, where Harvard University is, was very different — ",
    "zh": "以教授的身份重返校园时，哈佛大学所在的剑桥市已经很不一样了：",
    "vocabulary": [
      "professor"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "1befcfb606ca86500570ac16b4d4e7bfcd39d743c02153762aa5773394e2ee62",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "it was much more commercialized and cleaned-up than when I was an undergrad.",
    "zh": "与我读本科时相比，那里商业化程度更高，环境也更整洁。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "commercialize"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "07f436fc692f4beb91980c0d7082e1b8074f28125f3142056c7a371c664f1f10",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I liked being near Fresh Pond, and going to Walden.",
    "zh": "我喜欢住在弗雷什池附近，也喜欢去瓦尔登。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "near"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "5251f38a5e0d798a0503b187e25359f5f88a2d967ba643b6552f5788f2907fb6",
    "k": 39,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I felt like I was getting to know New England a little bit better, in a way that was very different from when I was 18.",
    "zh": "我觉得自己更加了解新英格兰了，而这种了解方式与我十八岁时很不一样。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "get to know"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "5032bbb68c34e7441d7a0516b1e139bda450e147902d9e3ded48d8545f70eeea",
    "k": 40,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "I liked that, and I was more aware of the environment,",
    "zh": "我很喜欢这种体验，也更加留意周围的环境。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "aware of"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "c24f67646e3f08759bf326583717721ff2abbba1dd6e8d620476fad8f4856149",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
    "en": "You write in My Poets about the power of listening to “poetry fans read those poems or works they are committed to.” ",
    "zh": "您在《我的诗人》中谈到了聆听诗歌爱好者朗读他们倾心的诗歌或作品所具有的力量。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "committed to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen046.png",
    "sha256": "086406af49ba1f6df56acff7c408954316ee6cce7c56020e7dcfd209feb7066b",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": "body",
